    {
      "id": "c2769e7c-f6db-4a1a-b3c7-59760fc52100",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-04-18T19:53:42.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2025 earnings released: EPS: ₹13.01 (vs ₹13.03 in FY 2024)",
      "body": "Full year 2025 results: EPS: ₹13.01 (down from ₹13.03 in FY 2024). Revenue: ₹21.0b (up 13% from FY 2024). Net income: ₹2.64b (flat on FY 2024). Profit margin: 13% (down from 14% in FY 2024). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 22% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 43% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
