    {
      "id": "4ba30d70-bc0c-4553-a459-90d008e17a00",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-03-02T08:52:44.000Z",
      "title": "Dividend of ₹1.50 announced",
      "body": "Shareholders will receive a dividend of ₹1.50. Ex-date: 30th April 2026 Payment date: 6th June 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.3%, which is lower than the industry average of 0.6%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (12% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (42% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 9.1% per year over the past 10 years and has been stable with no material reductions to payments, indicating a long track record of dividend growth and stability. EPS is expected to grow by 44% over the next 2 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
